# Search noise for agents. ripgrep (Claude Code Grep/Glob) reads .ignore files;
# Prettier and ESLint do not. A search that names a file, or a Read, still
# reaches everything listed: this hides it from directory-wide sweeps only.
# Executed plans are hidden by docs/superpowers/.ignore, which also holds for a
# search started inside docs/.
#
# A Grep `glob` that matches an ignored file (`*.yaml`) brings that file back:
# ripgrep treats --glob as an override. Ignored directories stay skipped.

/node_modules/
/test-output/
/coverage/
/pnpm-lock.yaml
